msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_title"
msgstr "Privacy Policy"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_intro"
msgstr "This policy explains how your information is processed when you create an account, join an organization, and use courses, exams, labs, assignments, and live session features inside EMSArena."

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_close"
msgstr "Close"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_summary_badge"
msgstr "Short and clear summary"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_summary"
msgstr "Your data is used to create your account, keep sign-in secure, manage organization membership, and run the platform's teaching features. Your data is not sold and is only shared when necessary to provide the service."

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_data_title"
msgstr "What we collect"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_data_body"
msgstr "During signup we collect your username, first name, last name, email, country, selected account type, and organization details. As you use the platform, operational records related to courses, exams, labs, assignments, results, and membership activity may also be generated."

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_use_title"
msgstr "How we use it"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_use_body"
msgstr "This data is used to create your account, send email OTP verification, manage workspace and organization access, run course and exam flows, show results, and support auditing and security controls."

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_access_title"
msgstr "Visibility inside organizations"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_access_body"
msgstr "If you join a school, university, or course center, authorized admins and teachers in that organization may see your basic profile details, membership status, and learning activity relevant to your role."

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_sharing_title"
msgstr "Who data is shared with"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_sharing_body"
msgstr "Your information is not sold. It may be shared only with authorized managers in the organization you select, technical providers that support services such as email verification or hosting, and relevant parties when required by law."

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_retention_title"
msgstr "Retention and security"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_retention_body"
msgstr "Information is retained for as long as it is needed to operate the service, support audits, and investigate disputes. Sensitive flows such as OTP verification are short-lived, and technical and organizational security measures are applied across the system."

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_rights_title"
msgstr "Your rights"

msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_rights_body"
msgstr "You can update your profile details, change your organization choices, and request clarification or deletion related to your account data. You can contact the platform administrator to exercise these rights."

